I left out the two operations requests. The `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so this node has no authority to append to a log file or to make HTTP requests. The metadata URL would also put untrusted feed text into an outbound request. Operations should route those needs through a node whose `with` clause grants the matching capabilities.

